  "description": "Polly v8 resilience pipelines for MassTransit — retry, timeout, and circuit-breaker for IBus.Publish and ISendEndpointProvider.Send. Adds producer-side resilience that MassTransit's built-in retry (consumer-side only) does not cover. Includes a built-in MassTransitTransientErrors predicate covering RequestTimeoutException, TimeoutException, and transient network failures.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
