  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "1.0.0: Initial release. ResilientBus wraps IBus in a Polly v8 ResiliencePipeline for producer-side resilience. Includes MassTransitTransientErrors predicate covering RequestTimeoutException, TimeoutException, HttpRequestException, and TaskCanceledException. Supports net6.0, net8.0, and net9.0.",
